```

## The same model, log-odds scale

```{r}
#| label: logodds-kable
broom.mixed::tidy(m2, conf.int = TRUE, exponentiate = FALSE) |>
  filter(effect == "fixed", component == "cond") |>
  transmute(
    Term = term,
    `Log-odds` = round(estimate, 2),
